specs/hal-engine-websocket-protocol/spec.md:309:- Each sent entry is blanked once, so a second suppression in the same stream repeats nothing ([validated by: blanks each sent entry once, so a second suppression repeats nothing](../../src/transport/ws/messageHandler.test.ts#L290)).
